                <note rend="inline" type="source">814.00/388: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Guatemala</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">McMillin</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Guatemala</hi></placeName>, [<date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-04-08"><hi rendition="#italic">April 8,
                        1920?</hi></date>].<lb/>[Received April 9—12:30 a.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>64. Department’s 21 [<hi rendition="#italic">29</hi>], April 1, 5 p.m. The two
                    designados of Guatemala are, first, General Mariano Serrano Muñoz and, second,
                    General Duarte.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">McMillin</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
